&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;KCP is a fast and reliable ARQ (Automatic Repeat reQuest) protocol that trades 10-20% additional bandwidth for 30-40% lower average latency and 3x lower maximum latency compared to TCP. It is designed for real-time applications where responsiveness is more critical than bandwidth efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>